.TH PORTCREATE 1 "2026-09-07" "@PROJECT_NAME@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
portcreate \- create a port template
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B portcreate
.RB [ -b	type ]
.I name
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B portcreate
creates a port directory containing the configured build script template. The generated template is intended to be edited before use with \fBpkgbuild\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -b BUILDER
Select the build system. Supported values are \fBautotools\fR (default), \fBmeson\fR, \fBcmake\fR, \fBgo\fR, \fBpython\fR, and \fBrush\fR.
.TP
.B -h
Show help.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
portcreate myport
portcreate -b meson myport
portcreate -b rust myport
.fi
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero on successful creation; non-zero for an invalid builder or existing/unwritable destination.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pkgbuild (1)
